{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>When all hope is swallowed by the abyss, only <strong>Battle</strong> proves your existence.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Die Deep&quot; is an action game that focuses purely on the confrontation between you and your enemy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map exploration, no puzzles, no excess\u2014everything is built around one thing: <strong>Battle</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your opponent\u2019s every move, find an opening, plan your strike, and attack with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One reckless swing, one moment of greed, and death will be your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of characters with their own motives and fighting styles, and seek the mysterious power that can rewrite fate. Descend into the abyss. Face death head-on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pure, Focused Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s battles focus on carefully observing enemy movements and seizing every opportunity to act. Plan your strategy wisely and strike with precision\u2014reckless attacks or getting greedy can lead to deadly consequences. But that doesn\u2019t mean your character is slow or clumsy; they possess agile moves and powerful skills, allowing you to truly shine while staying calm under pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.poster.avif?t=1759998662\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.webm?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/7a25744062afacfb8c8537f3c9ad14b3.mp4?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Shield-wielding warrior</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Playable Characters</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the one-eyed warrior skilled in perfect parries or the agile  thief wielding dual blades, each character boasts a distinct fighting style. Delve into their unique traits, harness each character's strengths, and discover your path to victory.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.poster.avif?t=1759998662\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.webm?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/984389ce33e2c3fb8c81e716bb64dd41.mp4?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Dual-blade rogue with storm-like speed</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tight and Exciting Continuous Battlegrounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the terrain automatically shifts, battles will come at you nonstop. You must seize every opportunity to catch your breath and recover, pushing through one challenge after another, continuously growing and preparing for the ultimate showdown against powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.poster.avif?t=1759998662\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.webm?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/b259c3b59750737c2f7f0a22391d48b6.mp4?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Don\u2019t forget to heal amid the intense battles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Versatile Combat Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul energy through victories to continually grow. Combine charms and skills to create your own unique fighting style as you pursue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/cf8cec43c17f340ae5a77ef5c007ba37.poster.avif?t=1759998662\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/cf8cec43c17f340ae5a77ef5c007ba37.webm?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211560/extras/cf8cec43c17f340ae5a77ef5c007ba37.mp4?t=1759998662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use Charms to forge your own combat style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211560?t=1759998662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211560?t=1759998662","ca